(7642796, 1241388, 124815, '<td valign="top">Soulful. Probably more than what R.Frank used to do, imo, since his people seem to be defined by the surrounding space not vice versa. <br/>I have trouble with all topics ''in the manner of" but this is a homage one and it''s very good</td>', 'Soulful. Probably more than what R.Frank used to do, imo, since his people seem to be defined by the surrounding space not vice versa. I have trouble with all topics ''in the manner of" but this is a homage one and it''s very good', '2019-10-01 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
