(7642804, 1241411, 124815, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - could be my runner up but the more I look, the more I am bothered by the person on the right in the doorway. I would have cropped that part or darken it substantially.<br/>Otherwise, a bold, strong picture - can never tell if it''s inspired by Frank but it is certainly a homage<br/>bump</td>', 'I like this a lot - could be my runner up but the more I look, the more I am bothered by the person on the right in the doorway. I would have cropped that part or darken it substantially.Otherwise, a bold, strong picture - can never tell if it''s inspired by Frank but it is certainly a homagebump', '2019-10-01 16:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
