(7642818, 1241273, 50695, '<td valign="top">This seems to capture a culture the way Frank does. A phone culture, a beauty culture, a selfie culture.<br/> <br/>I''ll hang this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This seems to capture a culture the way Frank does. A phone culture, a beauty culture, a selfie culture. I''ll hang this in my fantasy gallery ', '2019-10-01 23:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
