(7642849, 1241366, 5628, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for the votes and comments! I studied a lot of Robert Frank''s photos and really liked a series of portraits he did in 1959, of which "Andrea" was my favorite. This was my inspiration. <a href="https://www.mutualart.com/Artwork/Andrea--1959/82612906A53E70A1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Andrea, 1959 by Robert Frank </a></td>', 'Thanks everybody for the votes and comments! I studied a lot of Robert Frank''s photos and really liked a series of portraits he did in 1959, of which "Andrea" was my favorite. This was my inspiration. Andrea, 1959 by Robert Frank ', '2019-10-02 01:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
