(7642892, 1241338, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this a mannequin?<br/> <br/>Bizarre and cool, Larry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment Lydia. Yes it is a mannequin. We were walking in the streets of Quebec city and this caught me by surprise.  At first I thought she was alive until I looked closer.  I figured if it fooled me it would fool you also! Yes,  very bizarre:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-10-02 21:14:10.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: Is this a mannequin? Bizarre and cool, Larry.   Thanks for the comment Lydia. Yes it is a mannequin. We were walking in the streets of Quebec city and this caught me by surprise.  At first I thought she was alive until I looked closer.  I figured if it fooled me it would fool you also! Yes,  very bizarre:)', '2019-10-02 14:44:19.000000', '2019-10-02 22:14:10.000000', 0),
(7642893, 1241273, 19825, '<td valign="top">Is this a candid or a mirror selfie? Either way, nicely done.</td>', 'Is this a candid or a mirror selfie? Either way, nicely done.', '2019-10-02 14:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
