(7642927, 1241366, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Martus:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Great job, I really liked this one, congrats on another fine finish, ever since you said you wanted to give up you''ve done pretty well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Neat! Actually, I meant that I was done trying to understand the DPC voters... now Im entering shots I like. If they do well, great! If not, thats ok too. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> Thats great, and you will never understand the DPC voters...Ive been here long enough to know that. Enter what you love.</td>', 'Originally posted by Martus: Originally posted by Neat: Great job, I really liked this one, congrats on another fine finish, ever since you said you wanted to give up you''ve done pretty well.   Thanks Neat! Actually, I meant that I was done trying to understand the DPC voters... now Im entering shots I like. If they do well, great! If not, thats ok too.    Thats great, and you will never understand the DPC voters...Ive been here long enough to know that. Enter what you love.', '2019-10-02 21:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7643027, 1241378, 250302, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the congrats and votes!  I was in Sweden, sitting in a pub taking a lunch break, and saw the tram keep going by and thought of the Robert Frank photo of the bus.  So when we were done with lunch I stepped outside and waited for the next one and was able to catch these 2 couples that I thought was very similar to Robert Frank''s "bus" photograph.  I never imagined it would be on the front page, much less win blue!!</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the congrats and votes!  I was in Sweden, sitting in a pub taking a lunch break, and saw the tram keep going by and thought of the Robert Frank photo of the bus.  So when we were done with lunch I stepped outside and waited for the next one and was able to catch these 2 couples that I thought was very similar to Robert Frank''s "bus" photograph.  I never imagined it would be on the front page, much less win blue!!', '2019-10-04 10:22:01.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
